msgid "A dan course is a fixed set of charts, played back to back in one sitting, with an accuracy bar you have to finish above. Clearing the course awards you that level. Each keymode has its own community ladder, run by different people: 4K regular uses DDMythical's Reform courses, 4K LN uses the _Underjoy courses, 7K uses the JinJin courses, and 6K has two of its own, Arkman's ladder on the regular side and sunnyxxy's on the LN side."
