#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
msgid "A run only counts if it was really the course. Easy, No Fail and Random disqualify it, and so does anything that slows the chart down: Half Time, Daycore, or a custom rate under 1.0x. Mirror, Hidden, Fade In, Flashlight, Hard Rock, Sudden Death, Perfect and Double Time are all fine, because none of them make the course easier. A pass recorded before mod data was stored cannot be checked, so it counts for nothing rather than being taken on trust. <0>Clicking your dan badge shows the course that set your estimate, when one did.</0>"
msgstr "A run only counts if it was really the course. Easy, No Fail and Random disqualify it, and so does anything that slows the chart down: Half Time, Daycore, or a custom rate under 1.0x. Mirror, Hidden, Fade In, Flashlight, Hard Rock, Sudden Death, Perfect and Double Time are all fine, because none of them make the course easier. A pass recorded before mod data was stored cannot be checked, so it counts for nothing rather than being taken on trust. <0>Clicking your dan badge shows the course that set your estimate, when one did.</0>"

