#~ msgstr "Hitting the accuracy bar gives full credit for the chart's level. The next 1% above the bar still gives full credit. After that, bonus credit starts. It stays small until 99%, then rises faster. Scores below the bar can still count at a lower level. Regular charts count down to 4% below the bar, while 6K/7K LN charts count down to 1% below it. At those cutoffs, the chart counts as 1.25 levels lower. 4K LN counts down to 94.5%, where the chart is worth 1.5 levels less, and its bonus stops rising at 99.7%:"

