#: src/routes/privacy.tsx
msgid "Mania Tracker counts page views and feature usage with its own first-party analytics, stored on the site's own server. Events are sent through the site's own endpoint and can include the visited route, selected country, referrer, browser language, screen size, and route context such as a viewed player, score, beatmapset, or maps tab. Events are kept for 90 days and then deleted."
msgstr "Mania Tracker counts page views and feature usage with its own first-party analytics, stored on the site's own server. Events are sent through the site's own endpoint and can include the visited route, selected country, referrer, browser language, screen size, and route context such as a viewed player, score, beatmapset, or maps tab. Events are kept for 90 days and then deleted."

#: src/routes/terms.tsx
msgid "Mania Tracker displays public metadata, cached projections, and derived community views for reference. To report a bug, use the <0>Report a bug</0> form on the site. If you own content shown on the site and have an attribution, takedown, or data concern, email <1>contact@mania-tracker.com</1> or contact the maintainer through the public osu! profile linked in the footer."
msgstr "Mania Tracker displays public metadata, cached projections, and derived community views for reference. To report a bug, use the <0>Report a bug</0> form on the site. If you own content shown on the site and have an attribution, takedown, or data concern, email <1>contact@mania-tracker.com</1> or contact the maintainer through the public osu! profile linked in the footer."

#: src/routes/privacy.tsx
msgid "Mania Tracker does not sell personal data. Data may be processed by service providers used to run the site, including hosting, storage, analytics, osu! API services, and community score-data services. Public osu! data may be cached and re-displayed as part of the site's community features."
msgstr "Mania Tracker does not sell personal data. Data may be processed by service providers used to run the site, including hosting, storage, analytics, osu! API services, and community score-data services. Public osu! data may be cached and re-displayed as part of the site's community features."

#: src/routes/terms.tsx
msgid "Mania Tracker is a community project built on external data sources, so rankings, score views, snipes, top plays, maps, farm-helper suggestions, replay views, dan estimates, and other generated surfaces may be delayed, incomplete, unavailable, or incorrect. Features may change, break, or be removed."
msgstr "Mania Tracker is a community project built on external data sources, so rankings, score views, snipes, top plays, maps, farm-helper suggestions, replay views, dan estimates, and other generated surfaces may be delayed, incomplete, unavailable, or incorrect. Features may change, break, or be removed."

